              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa selokhu sayeka ukushisela indlovukazi yezulu impepho nokuyithululela iminikelo yokuphuzwa, santula yonke into futhi saqedwa ngenkemba nangendlala.",
